ootail (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * MCP stdio server mode (--mcp) with tool definitions for LLM coding agents.
  * Byte windowing (-c, --bytes) with positive offset (+NUM) support.
  * Line windowing from start offset (+NUM) and legacy flag (+NUM).
  * Inotify polling with configurable sleep interval (-s) and PID tracking (--pid).
  * Comprehensive 4-tier QA suite and performance benchmarks.

